# Collaboration workflow (Photo Organizer + all projects)

See also the user-global rule at `~/.cursor/rules/collaboration-workflow.mdc`.

Before non-trivial changes: **propose a plan → get approval → implement once.**

Do not implement large UI/feature changes from critiques or links without checking what already exists and what the user actually wants.
